# DESCRIPTION: App Store 专属分流规则（账号鉴权、商店浏览、TestFlight、下载CDN）

# ================= 1. 苹果账号鉴权与登录 =================
# 解决切换外区账号转圈、无法登录或无法弹出条款的问题
host, appleid.apple.com, AppStore
host, appleid.cdn-apple.com, AppStore
host, idmsa.apple.com, AppStore
host, gsa.apple.com, AppStore

# ================= 2. 商店页面、搜索、内购与 TestFlight =================
host-suffix, apps.apple.com, AppStore
host-suffix, itunes.apple.com, AppStore
host, ppq.apple.com, AppStore
host, beta.apple.com, AppStore
host, testflight.apple.com, AppStore
host-keyword, buy.itunes.apple.com, AppStore
host-suffix, mzstatic.com, AppStore

# ================= 3. 应用安装包下载与更新 CDN =================
# 若后续想让下载走国内宽带直连，只需在 GitHub 上把下面4行删掉或用 # 注释掉即可
# host, iosapps.itunes.apple.com, AppStore
# host, osxapps.itunes.apple.com, AppStore
# host, apptrailers.itunes.apple.com, AppStore
# host-suffix, blobstore.apple.com, AppStore
